<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
  <title>Страница не найдена</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300&amp;subset=cyrillic" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto+Slab&amp;subset=cyrillic" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/static/assets/fontanka.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
  <style>
      body {
          display: -webkit-box;
          display: flex;
          -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
          -webkit-box-direction: normal;
                  flex-direction: column;
          padding: 21px 12px 21px 12px;
          margin: 0;
      }
      .logo {
          width: 153px;
          height: 36px;
          margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .content {
          display: -webkit-box;
          display: flex;
      }
      .smile {
        width: 47px;
        height: 81px;
        padding-top: 5px;
        margin-right: 30px;
      }
      .text-wrapper {
          display: -webkit-box;
          display: flex;
          -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
          -webkit-box-direction: normal;
                  flex-direction: column;
      }
      .header {
        margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        font-family: 'Roboto Slab', Arial, serif;
        font-size: 21px;
        line-height: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #505050;
      }
      .text {
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        font-family: 'Roboto', Arial, serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 20px;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: #333333;
      }
      .link,
      .link:link,
      .link:visited,
      .link:hover {
          color: #f58220;
          text-decoration: none;
      }
      @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
        body {
          padding: 32px 30px 32px 30px;
        }
        .logo {
          width: 238px;
          height: 56px;
          margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
      }
      @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }
        .header {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .text {
            font-size: 17px;
        }
      }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a class="link" href="/"><img class="logo" src="/static/assets/logo.svg" alt=""></a>
    <div class="content">
        <img class="smile" src="/static/assets/smile.svg" alt="">
        <div class="text-wrapper">
            <h1 class="header">Страница не найдена</h1>
            <p class="text">Страница, к которой Вы обратились, не найдена на нашем сервере.</p>
            <p class="text">Попробуйте найти её с <a class="link" href="/">первой страницы сайта</a> или <a class="link" href="/cgi-bin/search.scgi">воспользуйтесь поиском</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
